{"unit_id":"xiciyang__training-sft#card-zh","repo":"xiciyang/training-sft","commit":"cfa1f0a5a10b84e5017c08efefeb9da233bc8c3f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@xiciyang/training-sft 是面向 DSH 的监督微调插件，通过注册训练工具串起数据准备、LoRA 训练、适配器合并和模型评估。它支持数据去重、确定性切分、评估集泄漏检查、训练预算限制、checkpoint 管理、评估门禁、运行回退和报告查询。适合需要在本地 GPU 环境微调基座模型并核验结果的开发者；需要本地基座模型、GPU、容器及训练镜像。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:119-150","src/tools.mjs:18-115","src/core.mjs:51-75"]}
{"unit_id":"xiciyang__training-sft#card-en","repo":"xiciyang/training-sft","commit":"cfa1f0a5a10b84e5017c08efefeb9da233bc8c3f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@xiciyang/training-sft is a DSH plugin for LoRA fine-tuning. Its tools prepare data, train models, merge adapters, evaluate results, manage checkpoints, and report runs. It checks leakage and applies budget and evaluation gates. A local model, GPU, container, and training image are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:119-150","src/tools.mjs:18-115","src/core.mjs:51-75"]}
